| 2 | 3 | false | 1.5213782252652706 | 8.8059464202761e-06 | true |
| 3 | 4 | false | 1.5213797067017258 | 6.112694794779827e-10 | true |
| 4 | 5 | false | 1.5213797068045676 | 0 | false |

Actual stop: residual. Capture units: 17.
